        "The design gives C0 only its row in table 5.1. The primary objective is composed from the Destination and Special rules cells. The secondary and stretch objectives are the generic examples of section 5.2, chosen to satisfy its structure (2 to 3 secondary, 1 stretch); they need confirmation by the design owner.",
        "Payload mass 0.1 t is stored as 100 kg.",
